00:00:13.045 --> 00:00:15.981
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:16.048 --> 00:00:22.555 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:29.128 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:31.630
-Welcome back.
-Whoa.

00:00:31.697 --> 00:00:33.800
