my pants on?

00:00:36.069 --> 00:00:37.036
How did you.

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:38.571
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.638 --> 00:00:40.439
-He getting mad 'cause I've got
people that do it for me.

00:00:40.506 --> 00:00:42.642
